4b892f4613ff,paper_candidate,"In parallel, UAVs 1 through 4 form a circle centered at [-4, 14, 3] with radius 2 meters in 7 seconds using smooth motion and safety factor 1.25, while UAVs 5 through 8 form a compact square around their current centroid with automatic duration, normal motion, and safety factor 1.0. Complete the parallel group synchronously.",1850,1834,25700,False,True,True,1.0,0,,,paper-candidate-en-v2,0327c1364145df3b5c990eef3328ee176b12bf496f4a81f7232ce99fb8e4dd91,paper-candidate-schema-v2,be6063a533f05b8d0b6e87353a40fb294975261fa1514cd5d34ced19ce2bffe7,MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed,0.0,0.01,paper_candidate
